{"abstract":"This one-day workshop seeks to bring together design researchers that have different orientations and practices for futures and futur- ing to unpack the role of futuring across design, design artefacts, and designers. Our goal in this workshop is to use examples of established futures to engage with and reflect on questions around the role of futures in HCI/design. We believe that there is a common thread between work from many different researchers, but that the people doing that work are spread across different disciplines and geographical locations. To that end, this workshop will assem- ble researchers working with different methods and approaches to futures in design and will aim to identify core challenges and opportunities for futures in HCI.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Jenkins, Tom","Tsaknaki, Vasiliki","Boer, Laurens","Kun, Peter","Howell, Noura","Wong, Richmond","Campo Woytuk, Nadia","Søndergaard, Maria Louise Juul"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-759409"],"event":{"acronym":"DIS","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","Sweden","United States"],"glorg":["AHO The Oslo School of Architecture and Design, Norway","All Global Affiliations","Georgia Institute of Technology","KTH Royal Institute of Technology"],"keyword":["Design Futuring","Design research","Futures"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mapping futures and futuring in hci design","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/%2010.1145/3656156.3658384","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-759409","identifier":[{"id":"85198906038","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-91abe117-12cd-4c3b-9943-34ab75c4ac66"],"keyword":["design futuring","design research","futures"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5E149DA731F91BC1D38C3C0F1DE88B83"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/105488248/2024_Jenkins_et_al_-_Mapping_Futures_and_Futuring_in_HCI_Design.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/%2010.1145/3656156.3658384","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Climate IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Digital Welfare","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Design Research Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Interaction Design Research Group","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, IxD Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"georgia institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"kth royal institute of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KTH Royal Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"no","key":"aho the oslo school of architecture and design norway","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AHO The Oslo School of Architecture and Design, Norway","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom","key":"jenkinspau","last":"Jenkins","locid":"3ad26d6b-4619-4a9f-a1b6-8424aab1dd52","name":"Jenkins, Tom","orcid":"0000-0001-6135-410X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vasiliki","key":"tsaknakipau","last":"Tsaknaki","locid":"805cae2a-3462-4130-88de-cc7d94aec0a5","name":"Tsaknaki, Vasiliki","orcid":"0000-0003-2235-6078","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Laurens","key":"boerpau","last":"Boer","locid":"25a5a0d6-404b-419c-9502-b246525617a2","name":"Boer, Laurens","orcid":"0000-0001-9723-5516","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"kunpau","last":"Kun","locid":"f30d35c6-4320-476f-8506-481764e6009e","name":"Kun, Peter","orcid":"0000-0003-0778-7662","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Noura","key":"howellpau","last":"Howell","name":"Howell, Noura","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Richmond","key":"wongpau","last":"Wong","name":"Wong, Richmond","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Nadia","key":"campowoytukpau","last":"Campo Woytuk","name":"Campo Woytuk, Nadia","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Maria Louise Juul","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","name":"Søndergaard, Maria Louise Juul","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3656156.3658384","pages":"458-461","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the Designing Interactive Systems Conference 2024"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85198906038"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-91abe117-12cd-4c3b-9943-34ab75c4ac66"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Mapping Futures and Futuring in HCI/Design","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-759409","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Human-Robot Interaction researchers and design researchers in- creasingly recognize that they can benefit from each other’s tools, methods, and approaches. However, there are practical and episte- mological barriers to productively do so. In this demonstration we show how we, as design researchers, developed a playground for making distinctive soft robotic surfaces that can quickly be assem- bled and experienced first-hand. As such, the playground and our process serves as an exemplar of a designerly way of working with HRI.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Boer, Laurens","Bewley, Harvey"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-759394"],"event":{"acronym":"DIS","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Human robot interaction","Play","Prototyping","Research through Design","Social robots","Soft Robots"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a playground for soft robot design","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3665663","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-759394","identifier":[{"id":"85198901036","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-36e0b9a7-0bf1-44a3-9dc7-e5804b2d6292"],"keyword":["Human-Robot Interaction","Play","Prototyping","Research through Design","Social Robots","Soft Robots"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9B904A1AC1170373AC0695AB3C1C74F8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/106297303/3656156.3665663.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3656156.3665663","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Design Research Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Interaction Design Research Group","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, IxD Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Laurens","key":"boerpau","last":"Boer","locid":"25a5a0d6-404b-419c-9502-b246525617a2","name":"Boer, Laurens","orcid":"0000-0001-9723-5516","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Harvey","key":"bewleypau","last":"Bewley","locid":"5d268f64-6963-4991-9ac4-e7510c0ae705","name":"Bewley, Harvey","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["itu-36e0b9a7-0bf1-44a3-9dc7-e5804b2d6292"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A Playground for Soft Robot Design","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-759394","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The mental and emotional burden of living with a chronic disease, such as Rheumatoid Arthritis (RA), calls for a better understanding of how we can support people in coping through affectively designed healthcare technologies. This paper presents findings from an ongoing research project concerned with redesigning an existing self-tracking app towards better supporting affective dimensions of living with RA. On the basis of an exploratory, intervention-based design study, we present three overall affective needs feeding into three design opportunities for cultivating affective and emotional dimensions in the redesign of the app; 1) creating a digital room for emotional response, 2) offering a space for mindfulness and 3) helping people to own their RA story. Our results emphasize the need for HCI and design researchers to approach the design of healthcare technology holistically, which includes exploring affective interactions that empower people to develop more sustainable coping strategies.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Kühn, Lena","Boer, Laurens","Fritsch, Jonas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-798563"],"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Affective Interaction Design","Health","Mental wellbeing","Rheumatoid arthritis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exploring app based affective interactions for people with rheumatoid arthritis","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.21606/drs.2024.895","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-798563","ids":["itu-ded5b5ed-01c7-4c36-a207-212a1efc1f7b"],"keyword":["affective interaction design","affective interactions","health","mental wellbeing","rheumatoid arthritis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-55B7F02765B6352A391DBACCA8CCE820"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.21606/drs.2024.895","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lena","key":"kühnpau","last":"Kühn","name":"Kühn, Lena","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Laurens","key":"boerpau","last":"Boer","locid":"25a5a0d6-404b-419c-9502-b246525617a2","name":"Boer, Laurens","orcid":"0000-0001-9723-5516","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpau","last":"Fritsch","locid":"d37cba38-dff2-4c27-a515-226cfadfd849","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0001-9065-2843","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.21606/drs.2024.895","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of DRS2024"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-ded5b5ed-01c7-4c36-a207-212a1efc1f7b"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Exploring app-based affective interactions for people with rheumatoid arthritis","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-798563","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"This one-day workshop will explore fabulations in design research. Bringing together design researchers and practitioners in hands-on exploration and critical dialogue, we will explore emerging practices and potentials of using fabulations in futures-oriented and exploratory practice-based design research. Drawing on fabulations’ relations with feminist technoscience and more-than-human concerns, we seek to understand if and how the practice of fabulating can contribute to designing vibrant worlds that can flourish in new ways.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Jenkins, Tom","Juul Søndergaard, Marie Louise","Sanches, Pedro","Tsaknaki, Vasiliki","Campo Woytuk, Nadia","Howell, Noura","Helms, Karey","Boer, Laurens","Tucker, Jason"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-718887"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","Sweden","United States"],"glorg":["AHO The Oslo School of Architecture and Design, Norway","All Global Affiliations","Georgia Institute of Technology","KTH Royal Institute of Technology","Malmö University","Umeå University"],"keyword":["Design research","Fabulations","Feminist Technoscience","More than Human Concerns","Practice Based Research"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fabulating futures for flourishing and vibrant worlds","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/100699342/177_submission.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-718887","ids":["itu-8c307203-7f4e-4edc-8514-f3cf70b8c2cd"],"keyword":["Design Research","Fabulations","Feminist Technoscience","More-than-Human Concerns","Practice-based Research"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BF7D4A13C4B1615C441B35456274B19B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-SA","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/100699342/177_submission.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Climate IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Center for Digital Welfare","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design, Design Research Section","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Interaction Design Research Group","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, IxD Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"aho the oslo school of architecture and design norway","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AHO The Oslo School of Architecture and Design, Norway","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"umeå university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Umeå University","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"se","key":"kth royal institute of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KTH Royal Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"georgia institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"se","key":"malmö university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Malmö University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom","key":"jenkinspau","last":"Jenkins","locid":"3ad26d6b-4619-4a9f-a1b6-84