{"abstract":"Turning on a water tap in one’s home is an easy, simple and typically solitary interaction that masks the huge amounts of resources and efforts behind the collection, processing, and delivery of fresh water. There are many design and design research examples that aim to raise environmental awareness by drawing attention to consumption of domestic utilities. However, less common are designs that aim to provoke reflection on sustainable behaviors through an effortful and shared interaction. In this paper we present ‘Touchy Tap’ - a multi-touch kitchen faucet prototype in the form of a dynamically illuminated 2-m wavy tube that requires control by two people. A slow interaction was designed with the intention to evoke reflections in use on issues related to water consumption. A preliminary evaluation indicates the potential of this ‘slow technology’ approach to highlight water consumption issues, even though the ambiguity of such an unconventional interface may negatively impact on overall user experiences.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Nakamura, Nanami","Mitchell, Robb","Boer, Laurens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-680229"],"event":{"end":"2022-11-22","place":"Faro, pt","start":"2022-11-21","title":"11th EAI International Conference on ArtsIT, Interactivity and Game Creation, ArtsIT 2022","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Mitchell, Robb"],"keyword":["Collaborative interaction","Social interaction","Tangible interaction","Water"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"touchy tap a slow technology for shared reflections on water consumption","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/215089384/Touchy_Tap_Submission_ArtsIT_2022_Nakamura_Mitchell_Boer.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["We thank Asger Bøgh Lautrop, Elena Garcia de la Fuente, and Emma Berlekovity for collaborating on the design and development of the Touchy Tap, and our study participants for their time and reflections."],"id":"S01-000.00-680229","identifier":[{"id":"85152571792","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-45a54a81-eb8e-4985-a199-051329586ff1"],"keyword":["collaborative interaction","faucets","kitchens","social interaction","tangible interaction","taps","water"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C3D0B3D49E784CCD75BE31EF189C386A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/215089384/Touchy_Tap_Submission_ArtsIT_2022_Nakamura_Mitchell_Boer.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Design and Communication, SDU Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nanami","key":"nakamurapau","last":"Nakamura","locid":"dfd32bbc-ccdc-4e88-bc08-0e07329c1dda","name":"Nakamura, Nanami","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Robb","key":"mitchellpau","last":"Mitchell","locid":"2e09e49e-5e3e-4a60-8766-df4bc3ad05db","name":"Mitchell, Robb","orcid":"0000-0002-8721-8330","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Laurens","key":"boerpau","last":"Boer","name":"Boer, Laurens","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Anthony L.","key":"brookspedh","last":"Brooks","name":"Brooks, Anthony L.","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-031-28993-4_44","eisbn":["9783031289934"],"isbn":["9783031289927"],"issn":["18678211"],"pages":"614-621","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes of the Institute for Computer Sciences, Social-Informatics and Telecommunications Engineering, LNICST","status":"p","subtitle":"11th EAI International Conference, ArtsIT 2022, Faro, Portugal, November 21-22, 2022, Proceedings","title":"ArtsIT, Interactivity and Game Creation"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85152571792"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-45a54a81-eb8e-4985-a199-051329586ff1"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Touchy Tap : A Slow Technology for Shared Reflections on Water Consumption","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-680229","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"A growing number of design researchers explore engagement with and through biodata. To help make sense of this growing space, we synthesize three emergent themes: (1) expanding notions of biodata and bodies, (2) attending to a greater diversity of human bodies and experiences with biodata, and (3) biodata collaborations between human and non-human bodies. We illustrate these themes with selected design examples. From this synthesis, we develop three interconnected fabulations reimagining alternative engagements with biodata: Weaving Alongside, Diffracting Selves, and Collective Affect. Our discussion unpacks conceptual work of the fabulations, offering invitations for design research to explore alternative ways of living and knowing together with biodata.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Tsaknaki, Vasiliki","Sanches, Pedro","Jenkins, Tom","Howell, Noura","Boer, Laurens","Bitzouni, Afroditi"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384356"],"event":{"acronym":"DIS","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Georgia Institute of Technology","Umeå University"],"keyword":["Biodata","Bodies","Design research","Diffraction","Fabulation","Futuring","More than human"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fabulating biodata futures for living and knowing together","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3532106.3533477","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384356","identifier":[{"id":"85133602322","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-d214142c-0b76-4bde-8b12-d0283d07c629"],"keyword":["biodata","bodies","design research","diffraction","fabulation","futuring","more-than-human"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1D18DF179DBF8E2C990117DB430C1DFB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3532106.3533477","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86911930/3532106.3533477.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Affective Interactions & Relations Lab"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"se","key":"umeå university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Umeå University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"georgia institute of technology","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Georgia Institute of Technology","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vasiliki","key":"tsaknakipau","last":"Tsaknaki","locid":"805cae2a-3462-4130-88de-cc7d94aec0a5","name":"Tsaknaki, Vasiliki","orcid":"0000-0003-2235-6078","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Pedro","key":"sanchespau","last":"Sanches","name":"Sanches, Pedro","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tom","key":"jenkinspau","last":"Jenkins","locid":"3ad26d6b-4619-4a9f-a1b6-8424aab1dd52","name":"Jenkins, Tom","orcid":"0000-0001-6135-410X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Noura","key":"howellpau","last":"Howell","name":"Howell, Noura",